STEP 1 - REPRODUCE THE CLAIM'S ARITHMETIC  [source A]
============================================================================================
Total revenue         FY26 $4,920m  FY25 $4,007m   delta +$913m  = +22.79%   (filing text: '+$913 million, or 23%')
SoftBank affiliate    FY26 $704.4m  FY25 $145.5m  delta +$558.9m  = 61.2% of total growth
Arm China IPLA        FY26 $790.6m  FY25 $670.4m  delta +$120.2m  = 13.2% of total growth
  SUM                                                        +$679.1m  = 74.4% of total growth   <-- claim says 74.4%

Ex-SoftBank-affiliate AND ex-Arm-China: $3,425.0m vs $3,191.1m = +7.33%   <-- claim says +7.3%

VERDICT ON ARITHMETIC: every figure reproduces to the stated precision.

