STEP 2 - ATTACK: DOES EXCLUDING ARM CHINA SURVIVE SCRUTINY?  [source A]
============================================================================================
Excluding ONLY the SoftBank affiliate consulting fee:
  $4,215.6m vs $3,861.5m = +9.17%   (NOT +7.3%; the claim's own 61.2% share implies this)
Arm China IPLA growth FY25->FY26: +17.9%  (and it was FLAT FY24->FY25: $670.8m -> $670.4m, -0.06%)
Cross-check vs geography: PRC revenue $749m -> $874m = +$125m (+16.7%), consistent with Arm China +$120.2m -> the Arm China delta is PRC end-demand, not a SoftBank cheque.

