============================================================================================
Arm China / total   = 16.07%  -> disclosed 'largest customer 16%'
SB affiliate / total= 14.32%  -> disclosed 'second largest 14%'
Item 3D names Arm China explicitly as 'our largest customer individually' and says top-5
'(including Arm China and SoftBank Group)' = 57%/56%/54% of revenue FY26/25/24. So the
IDENTITY of #1 is DISCLOSED; the identity of the 14% customer is INFERRED (well-supported).
Third-largest customer = 12% (~$590m) is NOT named in Note 4; Item 3D separately discloses
Qualcomm at 9% of FY26 revenue, so the 12% customer is a DIFFERENT, unnamed customer.

